{"id":"seguramente","lemma":"seguramente","pos":"adv","rank":1016,"glosses":["surely; certainly"],"ipa":"/seˌɡuɾaˈmente/","order":1127,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-seguramente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Seguramente me gustará este libro.","en":"Perhaps I'll like this book.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707157","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"book"}]},{"text":"Seguramente necesitarás hacer eso ahora.","en":"You most certainly will need to do that now.","words":[null,{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"Tarde o temprano, seguramente tendrás éxito.","en":"You are sure to succeed in time.","words":[null,null,null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"success"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"sooner or later"]]}]}